# Repositories (re)created under ~/work on every `make provision`.
# One per line:  <name> [git-url]
# <name> becomes ~/work/<name>. Blank lines and # comments are ignored. Applied
# by bootstrap.sh step_remotes, which runs `remote-session clone` for each
# entry (clone if missing + workspace trust; idempotent). No entry starts a
# server: the only one is `work` (claude-remote.service), and project sessions
# are opened on demand with `remote-session open <name>`.
workbench https://github.com/msavdert/workbench.git
dba-to-dbre https://github.com/msavdert/dba-to-dbre.git
suhuf https://github.com/msavdert/suhuf.git
agentshard https://github.com/msavdert/agentshard.git
quant-research https://github.com/msavdert/quant-research.git
